---
// Lingua Forte wordmark.
// "Lingua" (Latin: tongue, everyday speech) in the sans, upright.
// "Forte" (Latin: strength, expertise) in the display serif, italic.
// The sans/serif + upright/italic split is the brand signature,
// echoed by the italic emphasis words used across the site.
// Color split carries the brand: "Lingua" in primary forest (sage in dark
// mode for contrast), "Forte" in the amber accent. Both weighted semibold so
// the serif italic reads as a peer to the sans, not fragile beside it. As a
// logotype the wordmark is exempt from WCAG text-contrast, so amber is fine.
---
<span class="font-sans font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary dark:text-[#6FB389]">
  Lingua <span class="font-display font-semibold italic text-accent">Forte</span>
</span>
